  <title>Unit 9 Overview and Readiness</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02309</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Unit 9 Overview and Readiness</md:title>
    <md:uuid>4d22427f-5f1e-43e9-b5db-24709804fe04</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>In this unit, students will:</para>
<list>
  <item>Simplify radical expressions involving square roots.</item>
  <item>Solve quadratic equations by taking the square root, completing the square, and using the quadratic formula.</item>
</list>
<para>To accomplish these unit-level learning goals, students will complete the following lessons and activities.</para>
<title>Student Readiness for Unit 9</title>
<para>To be ready for this unit, students will need to be able to:</para>
<list>
  <item>Solve linear equations using a general strategy.</item>
  <item>Classify equations.</item>
  <item>Identify points on a graph.</item>
</list>
<para>This Unit Overview Video will provide a big picture look at the content found in this unit as well as the prerequisite skills that students need for accessing the content in the unit.</para>

<div class="os-raise-d-flex-nowrap os-raise-justify-content-center">
